WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.529
What happened when the Desire Camera took
a photo of SCP-002, the Living Room?

00:00:05.529 --> 00:00:09.950
The photo was taken while 002 was at rest
in its containment chamber, and the output

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.209
was a well-furnished foyer in the style of
SCP-002.

00:00:14.209 --> 00:00:17.039
An unlit hallway extends in the opposite direction.

00:00:17.039 --> 00:00:22.960
This suggests that 002 has some ambitious
plans for expanding its interior…

